    "The separate qualification editor workspace selects its own execution flags. The generic development launcher still selects the ordinary family workspace; development editor routing needs separate enrollment.",
    "The shared helper defaults remain unchanged for other families. Only accache opts into the new editor execution flags and compiler argument capture here."
